Konteks eksekusi: POST /api/telegram/webhook di production (VERCEL_ENV=production) → validateProductionEnvironment() → telegramEnvironment() → guard secret/header → configuredRouter() (Sheets config → Google client → ledger → AI provider → router). Setiap throw di rantai ini → catch → 503. Fakta ~200ms + tanpa outgoing** artinya gagal **sebelum** network call pertama (Sheets/Telegram) — yaitu di validasi env atau setup configuredRouter()`.

